{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104114","id":2393277177,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OpoL5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104114","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104114.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104114","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104114/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104114/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104114/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d6da30e9c77825530702bd37a557a42f8c86d814","number":104114,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Fix head class range to include `class_name`","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/issues/820\r\n\r\nThe parsing code would reset the beginning of the class whenever encountering `class_name` or `extends`, there is a check to prevent this from happening twice but it is faulty. It checks whether the current beginning position is on line 1 (the default). But this also means the extents will be reset if either `extends` or `class_name` are found on the first line, which means the corresponding statement would not be inside the range anymore.\r\n\r\nThis leads to problems with the lsp spec, since `class_name` as selection target MUST be within the symbol range.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes this behavior to only apply to the first of both that is encountered (regardless of line). It is still a bit inconsistent with classes that don't have either, because for those, the annotations are part of the range. But that isn't really related to the issue and does not cause any problems I'm aware of.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.